  "//": "Fetched by the client's General tab 'Download Latest Configuration' button (see src/trigger_presets.rs). Editing this file updates every client's preset picker without a code change or a release — see .github/workflows/ci.yml's paths-ignore entry for this filename, which keeps that cheap.",
  "version": 1,
  "presets": [
